      <h1>The $19,000 Baby Bill Nobody Warns Americans About (Germany Pays $0)</h1>
      <p class="dek">Two babies born the same night, 4,800 miles apart. Anna in Munich paid $0. Sarah in Florida got a $19,000 bill, with good insurance. Here is the entire first year, line by line.</p>

      <div class="video-wrap">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UDBl4X__7Oo" title="The $19,000 Baby Bill Nobody Warns Americans About (Germany Pays $0)" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>
